  "problem": "Receipt-only reconciliation classified a closed namespace-origin denial as temporary I/O, triggering unnecessary peer discovery and invalidating current leader advice.",
  "contract": [
    "Authenticate terminal origin denial using the existing response frame, full request-body digest, request tag, sequence and TLS exporter.",
    "Only command, command-probe and receipt purposes consume this result. Other purposes retain their contracts.",
    "A denied namespace grant cannot enter SQL staging or an application callback. Physical role and process fences remain separate.",
    "Preserve command identity and ambiguity. Permission denial is not proof of non-commit and never grants mutation replay.",
    "Keep original deadlines, finite route tickets, resource banks, shared workers, exact receipt and S3 requirements.",
    "Use the existing bounded receive I/O owner and original node/peer receive banks."
  ],
